; Two read patterns may select one occurrence: Core.lean's shapes ask the
; taken occurrences to be distinct, not the read ones. The row (p 1) alone
; gives (two 1 1); with (p 2) every pair of the two rows is read.
(step one)
(p 1)
(p 2)
(rule both (read (p $x) (p $y)) (absent (two $x $y)) (make (two $x $y)))
